  "description": "The Heavenly Demon, head of the Demonic Cult, is the most powerful martial artist in the gangho. But one day, a mysterious force suddenly traps him on an uninhabited island crawling with demonic beasts! There, he finds a room packed with streaming equipment, and realizes that not only has much changed in the outside world, but he and his cult were declared dead long ago. His only lead for getting off the island and reclaiming his former glory is a modern streaming platform called Kwitch. His first move? Rejuvenate himself into a youthful body, transform into a cute girl streamer, and start gathering followers!\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
